;- LabelPickupVacuumOk           IS INP36  ; FREE AIR
;- LabelPickupDownSol            IS OUT37 ; FREE AIR 
;- VacuumGenerator1Sol           IS OUT38 ; Venturi for label pickup suction cup vacuum
;- LabelArmDownSol               IS OUT39 ; MAIN PICK UP ARM  up-down, NO is up
