;- LabelArmInOutSol              IS OUT41 ; move arm in (when off, moves out)
;- LabelArmUpSol                 IS OUT42 ; not longer in use moved to out39 NC
;- LabelPickupUpDownSol          IS OUT43 ; switches between pressure and vacuum (NC is up)
